+[
+  {
+    "id": "V001",
+    "entry_point": "split_record",
+    "prompt": "实现 split_record(s)。s 是一个字符串，表示用分号分隔的一条记录；换行也只是普通字符，不表示记录结束。返回字段字符串列表。\n空输入返回 ['']；连续或末尾分号产生空字段。所有空白原样保留。\n字段可以不加引号，也可以从字段的第一个字符开始用双引号包围。不加引号的字段不能含双引号。\n加引号的字段内部允许分号；两个连续双引号代表一个字面双引号；结束双引号后必须紧接分号或输入结束，不能有空格。未闭合引号或其他违反这些规则的输入均抛 ValueError。\n例如 split_record('a;\"b;c\";') == ['a', 'b;c', '']。",
+    "reference": "def split_record(s):\n    result, i = [], 0\n    while True:\n        out = []\n        if i < len(s) and s[i] == '\"':\n            i += 1\n            while True:\n                if i == len(s): raise ValueError()\n                if s[i] != '\"':\n                    out.append(s[i]); i += 1\n                elif i + 1 < len(s) and s[i+1] == '\"':\n                    out.append('\"'); i += 2\n                else:\n                    i += 1; break\n            if i < len(s) and s[i] != ';': raise ValueError()\n        else:\n            while i < len(s) and s[i] != ';':\n                if s[i] == '\"': raise ValueError()\n                out.append(s[i]); i += 1\n        result.append(''.join(out))\n        if i == len(s): return result\n        i += 1\n",
+    "tests": "assert split_record('') == ['']\nassert split_record(';;') == ['', '', '']\nassert split_record('a;\"b;c\";') == ['a', 'b;c', '']\nassert split_record('\"\";\"a\"\"b\"') == ['', 'a\"b']\nassert split_record(' a ;\" x \";\\n') == [' a ', ' x ', '\\n']\nassert split_record('\"\\n\"') == ['\\n']\nfor bad in ['\"', '\"a\" ', 'a\"b', '\"a\"b', ' \"a\"', '\"\"\"']:\n    try: split_record(bad)\n    except ValueError: pass\n    else: raise AssertionError(bad)\nimport itertools\nfor fields in itertools.product(['', 'x', 'a;b', '\"', '\\n', ' x '], repeat=3):\n    encoded = ';'.join('\"' + f.replace('\"', '\"\"') + '\"' for f in fields)\n    assert split_record(encoded) == list(fields)\n",
+    "mutants": [
+      {
+        "name": "单规则偏差",
+        "code": "def split_record(s):\n    result, i = [], 0\n    while True:\n        out = []\n        if i < len(s) and s[i] == '\"':\n            i += 1\n            while True:\n                if i == len(s): raise ValueError()\n                if s[i] != '\"':\n                    out.append(s[i]); i += 1\n                elif i + 1 < len(s) and s[i+1] == '\"':\n                    out.append('\"'); i += 2\n                else:\n                    i += 1; break\n            if i < len(s) and s[i] != ';': raise ValueError()\n        else:\n            while i < len(s) and s[i] != ';':\n                if s[i] == '\"': raise ValueError()\n                out.append(s[i]); i += 1\n        result.append(''.join(out).strip())\n        if i == len(s): return result\n        i += 1\n"
+      }
+    ]
+  },
+  {
+    "id": "V002",
+    "entry_point": "normalize_segments",
